## Symptom

write_connector_state_error (c2c_relay_connector.ml:1711-1757) rebuilds connector-state.json with registered empty and no node_id/sessions keys (only wedge fields carried over). One transient sync exception erases the ownership evidence: connector_owns_alias returns None so the B294 CLI register guard reopens the alias-theft window, and connector_peek_key loses the binding so monitor/B231 peeks fall back to cli-alias keys and hit signature_invalid, until the next good pass rewrites the file.

## Fix direction

Preserve registered/sessions/node_id the same way the wedge fields are preserved (read-modify-write).

## Evidence

Connector review 2026-09-17.